BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Florida advisory interpretation concerning a nonlawyer recovery company, and run almost all their claims through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (attorneys [ouYE5P3UJdQ @ 00:10:42]. Richardson presents form-based filing as an accessible operator route;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Diamond separates the routes by procedure and capital; Taren emphasizes restrictions on who may act for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (compensation. The practical disagreement is about more than how difficult a form looks. Taren's county-specific) Tj ET
