BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (attorney expense an explicit part of choosing which claims to pursue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Notarization produces three distinct playbooks. Church says they have successfully directed clients to get agreements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (notarized themselves, while acknowledging that other operators send someone to the client's door with the paperwork) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm ([A47AbsTHlkY @ 00:03:00]. SurplusFundsRiches favors the mobile approach because speed and convenience matter:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (another operator may call, the claimant may move, and the claimant may lack printing money or easy transportation.) Tj ET
