BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (a different firsthand experience. After discovering on Sunday that an attorney needed a notarized document back) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (Monday, they used notarize.com rather than their closed bank. They uploaded the document, photographed their ID,) Tj ET
